flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> A

    A["Step 1 - Get-GitHub-Directory-v2
    GET api.github.com/repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}
    X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28  |  Auth: Basic"] --> B

    B["Step 2 - JSONPath Queries on Directory Response
    $.length()  -> NumberFiles
    $..name     -> GithubFileList array"] --> C

    C["Step 3 - Execute Python Script
    Extract last segment of GITHUB-PATH
    Strip non-alpha characters -> CATC-ProjectName"] --> D

    D{TemplateHubProjectName<br/>provided?} -->|No - use path| E1
    D -->|Yes - use input| E2

    E1["Set Project Variables - Branch A
    ProjectName    = GITHUB-PATH
    CATC-ProjectName = Python cleaned path segment
    GithubFileList = names array
    NumberFiles    = Length"] --> F

    E2["Set Project Variables - Branch B
    ProjectName    = TemplateHubProjectName
    CATC-ProjectName = TemplateHubProjectName
    GithubFileList = names array
    NumberFiles    = Length"] --> F

    F(["For each file in GithubFileList"]) --> G

    G{File extension<br/>matches yml?} -->|No - skip| F
    G -->|Yes| H

    H["Step 5a - Get-GitHub-File-v2
    GET api.github.com/repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}/{file}
    Header: Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json
    Returns: raw YAML composite template definition"] --> I

    I["Step 5b - Execute Python Script
    Replace .yml extension with .j2
    Derive matching Jinja2 template filename -> TemplateName"] --> J

    J["Step 5c - Set File Data
    OUTPUT      = YAML file raw content
    TemplateName = .j2 filename derived from .yml"] --> K

    subgraph STEP5D["Step 5d - CATC-CreateCompositeTemplate-v3"]
        direction TB
        K["1) GET /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/project
        Find or create project by ProjectName in Template Hub"] --> K2
        K2["2) Check if composite template already exists
        GET /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/project/{id}/template
        Filter by TemplateName"] --> K3
        K3{"Template<br/>exists and<br/>FORCE=false?"} -->|Yes - skip| K5
        K3 -->|No or FORCE=true| K4
        K4["3) Parse YAML body for composite sequence
        Identify member template references in sequence order
        GET /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/template
        Resolve each member template name to template ID"] --> K4B
        K4B["4) POST /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/project/{id}/template
        Body: name=TemplateName, language=JINJA
        softwareType=IOS-XE, composite=true
        containingTemplates: ordered member template ID list
        deviceTypes: C9000/C9300/C9400/C9500 Series"] --> K5
        K5["5) Return compositeId of created or existing template"]
    end

    K5 --> L["Step 5e - Set Variables
    Store CompositeId returned by CATC-CreateCompositeTemplate-v3"] --> M{More files<br/>in GithubFileList?}

    M -->|Yes| F
    M -->|No| N

    N["Step 6 - Sleep 30 Seconds
    Allow Template Hub to settle after composite creation"] --> O

    O["Step 7 - CATC-CommitTemplate-v2
    POST /dna/intent/api/v1/template-programmer/template/version
    Body: templateId = CompositeId
    Commits and versions the composite template (publishes it)"] --> DONE([Done])

    style DONE fill:#27ae60,color:#fff,stroke:#1e8449
    style START fill:#2980b9,color:#fff,stroke:#1a5276
